"{name} (hub: {site})":"{name} (Hub: {site})",
"{n} fiber pairs in your {a}–{b} trench. Trenching was the expensive part, so they want all of it":"{n} Faserpaare in deinem Graben {a}–{b}. Das Graben war der teure Teil, also wollen sie alles",
